{"id":"ea0e84ad87980968","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-computable-preserves-ml.md","title":"可计算保测映射保持 ML 随机性","display":"thm-computable-preserves-ml — 可计算保测映射保持 ML 随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-computable-preserves-ml","aliases":["43-thm-computable-preserves-ml"],"display":"thm-computable-preserves-ml — 可计算保测映射保持 ML 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]","[[43-df-rpreserving]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-mltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-computable-preserves-ml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-computable-preserves-ml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-computable-preserves-ml — 可计算保测映射保持 ML 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6bfdcc738fbd87ec\" href=\"?note=6bfdcc738fbd87ec\" title=\"43-df-computable-cantor-map\">43-df-computable-cantor-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47114eccf2042715\" href=\"?note=47114eccf2042715\" title=\"43-df-rpreserving\">43-df-rpreserving</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\">\\(\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币Borel概率空间；相关谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6bfdcc738fbd87ec\" href=\"?note=6bfdcc738fbd87ec\" title=\"43-df-computable-cantor-map\">43-df-computable-cantor-map</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"47114eccf2042715\" href=\"?note=47114eccf2042715\" title=\"43-df-rpreserving\">43-df-rpreserving</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\operatorname{ComputableCantorMap}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\Phi^{-1}[B],\\mu(B))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\operatorname{ComputableCantorMap}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\Phi^{-1}[B],\\mu(B))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：把ML检验逐层拉回。统一有效开性由总可计算映射的有限计算见证保证，保测性维持2^{-n}界。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable-cantor-map","status":"resolved","id":"6bfdcc738fbd87ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rpreserving","status":"resolved","id":"47114eccf2042715","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rpreserving]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$，$\\mu$、$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间；相关谓词见 [[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]、[[43-df-rpreserving]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-cantor-map","status":"resolved","id":"6bfdcc738fbd87ec","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$，$\\mu$、$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间；相关谓词见 [[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]、[[43-df-rpreserving]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false},{"targe